	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Select one or more images in Finder, trigger Alfred Universal Actions, and choose:

- Optimize Image: Fast, zero-prompt optimization saving collision-safe copies beside originals (skips files that are already optimal).
- Convert Image: Opens a native Alfred 6 UI to pick format (WebP, JPEG, PNG, AVIF, HEIC, TIFF, GIF, or Keep Original Format for advanced optimization), quality, lossless mode, EXIF preservation, and optional real-time size measurement (⌘P) before saving (↩︎).

Requires macOS built-ins (sips) plus Homebrew webp (cwebp/gif2webp) for WebP output. Optional: imagemagick (SVG, alpha-to-JPEG, animated WebP) and oxipng (stronger lossless PNG compression).</string>
